        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "3bd36b82-faa3-592a-9c34-892b6114712c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Petty, Bobby Gillespie, Murray Dalglish\n- Bands: Tom Petty and the Heartbreakers, Traveling Wilburys, Mudcrutch, Primal Scream, The Jesus and Mary Chain\n- Products: Highway Companion\n\nFacts:\n- In early 1984, Murray Dalglish became the original drummer for The Jesus and Mary Chain at the band's formation.\n- In November 1984, Bobby Gillespie replaced Murray Dalglish as drummer for The Jesus and Mary Chain.\n- In the mid-1980s, Bobby Gillespie was the drummer for The Jesus and Mary Chain.\n- In the late 1980s, Tom Petty was a member and co-founder of the supergroup Traveling Wilburys under the pseudonyms Charlie T. Wilbury Jr. and Muddy Wilbury.\n- Bobby Gillespie is the lead singer and founding member of Primal Scream.\n- Tom Petty is best known as the lead singer of Tom Petty and the Heartbreakers.\n- Tom Petty was also associated with his early band Mudcrutch.\n- Highway Companion is the third solo studio album by American singer-songwriter Tom Petty.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
